[FINAL LAP fix: 1 echo layer instead of 5]
author=fvhcookie-bit (ReFusion project)
description=Only for older PCSX2 versions where the 3D race messages (FINAL LAP, lap times, records) slow the game down: draws them with one echo layer instead of five. Not needed with PCSX2 2.8.
patch=1,EE,001dcfd4,word,2a020001

[FINAL LAP fix: no FINAL LAP text]
author=fvhcookie-bit (ReFusion project)
description=Removes the FINAL LAP 3D text entirely (the announcer still says it). Other messages are untouched.
